# Baseline for untouched 1.x code in McpKillSwitch.php and
# mcp_sentinel.install. Regenerated under PHPStan max +
# phpstan-strict-rules. New DEV-986 code must not add entries.
# Counts are identifier+path from Tests 39093627657 after excluding
# DEV-986 Commands, keep/revert, and 10037 helpers. The two extra
# argument.type hits are fetchAll(PDO::FETCH_ASSOC) on the 10037
# helpers (same portable ignore as phpstan.operator.neon).
